WEBVTT

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:01.422
how you might get started
creating your own stories

00:05:01.464 --> 00:05:03.632
and activating
your own sexual imagination.

00:05:04.258 --> 00:05:07.595
I won't take this too far.
You don't have to follow along right now.

00:05:07.636 --> 00:05:09.597
But consider this a guide

00:05:09.638 --> 00:05:11.807
for the next time
you get a little me time.

00:05:13.184 --> 00:05:14.435
(Laughter)

00:05:15.269 --> 00:05:17.355
First, you'll want to settle
into your mind

00:05:17.355 --> 00:05:19.565
the same way that you
might start a meditation.

00:05:21.108 --> 00:05:23.444
Then imagine that your mind
is like a projector.

00:05:23.444 --> 00:05:27.198
Everything you can see and experience
is what's right in front of you.

00:05:27.198 --> 00:05:29.992
Everything to your left,
right, behind you,

00:05:29.992 --> 00:05:31.243
that's out of frame.